# Ash Enterprise: 17 - Rules

Effort: **medium** — standalone, pure, one exercise. *You'll feel absence become an answer in its own right.*

```elixir
# Pure: runs standalone too.
Application.put_env(:ash, :default_string_length_count, :codepoints)

Mix.install([{:ash_rules, github: "lukegalea/ash_rules"}])
```

## Rules are data

